
<!ELEMENT ActionMaps (actionmap)*>
<!ELEMENT actionmap (action)*>
<!ATTLIST actionmap
        name CDATA #REQUIRED
        version CDATA #REQUIRED>
<!ELEMENT action (key)*>
<!ATTLIST action
